### Page 1 of 5

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:
FROM:
DATE:
Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
July 2, 2024
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-17-24 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne
and Miller & Sons Construction, Inc. for the 2024 Miscellaneous Concrete Project
______________________________________________
Bid #S-17-24 was solicited for the 2024 Miscellaneous Concrete Project (Vicinity Map Included).
Five (5) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1. Miller & Sons Construction Inc
2. S&S Builders LLC
3. JTL Group Inc. dba Knife River
4. Reiman Corp.
5. Simon Contractors
The bids were reviewed by Doug Klahn (1% Construction), and Tom Cobb (Engineering) and
their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Miller & Sons Construction, Inc.
The total Bid Award is $835,089.40
Project Completion is scheduled for July 31, 2025.
Funding:
020-26-2616-42-43492 (1% Sales Tax 23-26 / Miscellaneous Concrete)
```

